---

## UI Craft: Product Showcase — Landing Header + Bento

**Stack:** vanilla HTML/CSS + minimal JS · **Theme:** light + dark + system · **States:** complete

---

### Tokens & Architecture

| Token | Light | Dark |
|---|---|---|
| `--bg` | `#f4f5f9` cool off-white | `#09090e` blue-black |
| `--surface` | `#ffffff` | `#111118` |
| `--accent` | `#4639d4` deep electric indigo | `#7c72f5` |
| `--fg` | `#0d0e14` | `#f0f0f8` |
| `--muted` | `#676a7e` | `#9293a7` |
| `--glass-bg` | `rgba(255,255,255,0.74)` | `rgba(17,17,24,0.80)` |

**Z-index scale:** `--z-sticky:100`, `--z-dropdown:200`, `--z-command:300`, `--z-modal:400`, `--z-toast:500`

**Layout:** Left-aligned hero (editorial break from centered default) → 12-col bento: 8+4, 6+6, 4+4+4

**Fonts:** Syne 800 (headings) + Inter 400/500/600 (body) via Google Fonts

